+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/GARRY> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Numerous veins. Granodiorite with subsidiary leucogranite and trace diorite, intrusion-breccia and tuffisite."@en .
