+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BAUM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ultramafic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
