+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/EGTI> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sandy diamicton. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage (Quaternary Period) (.116-.0118 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAIL1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Syenite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAIL2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Syenite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAIL3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Syenite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAILU> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ultramafic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
